cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SynthAudit-Bench, please cite it by name and version with its DOI
  (added at the first benchmark release; see docs/identity.md and GOVERNANCE.md).
  The benchmark is cited separately from the accompanying paper.
title: >-
  SynthAudit-Bench: A Reference-Free Structural Trustworthiness Benchmark for
  Synthetic Tabular Datasets
abstract: >-
  A reference-free benchmark that measures how well an auditing system recovers,
  from a released tabular file alone, the structural artifacts that can
  invalidate that file as a machine-learning benchmark. Comprises the Structural
  Trustworthiness Ontology, census and evaluation corpora, a tool-agnostic
  auditing task with baselines, a report-card schema, and a compliance suite.
type: software
authors:
